   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Student E1→E24 (web or app): login, submission with receipt, shard, queue, Spot worker with sandbox, LLM minions grade the rubric, grade, push and output.   Professor P1→P8: assignment and rubric, no environment setup.   J1-J2: Teaching Assistant.   A1-A2: IT Administrator.\nEverything outside the orange box runs on the PERMANENT PLANE (on-demand and managed Multi-AZ services), where student and professor data lives.",
   "originalText": "Student E1→E24 (web or app): login, submission with receipt, shard, queue, Spot worker with sandbox, LLM minions grade the rubric, grade, push and output.   Professor P1→P8: assignment and rubric, no environment setup.   J1-J2: Teaching Assistant.   A1-A2: IT Administrator.\nEverything outside the orange box runs on the PERMANENT PLANE (on-demand and managed Multi-AZ services), where student and professor data lives.",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
